<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Base vs. Instruct Models</h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report ablation studies of Base vs. Instruct models in <a href="#A6.T4" title="In Appendix F Base vs. Instruct Models ‣ RECON: Reasoning with Condensation for EfficientRetrieval-Augmented Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
